  questId: c4_ledger
  questName: The Staff Ledger
  primaryRiasec: C
  questionCode: C4
  objectiveText: Put the staff records in order.
  questDescription: The school office is behind on its staff records - forms in loose
    piles on the floor, names entered wrong in the ledger, nothing in the right drawer.
  questHints:
  - Three piles are still on the floor - gather them first.
  - Or read the ledger properly; the errors are in the names.
  nextQuestId: 
  lockType: 0
  requiredSkillTag: 
